msgid ""
"Profile / account dropdown — opened from the global top bar.\n"
"\n"
"The contents are drawn natively by `layout.mixar_profile_card()`\n"
"(`interface_mixar_profile_card.cc`): a greeting, the plan chip, the\n"
"credit usage meter and the account actions, laid out as one card\n"
"rather than a menu. Python still owns registration and every\n"
"operator the card invokes — C++ owns only pixels.\n"
msgstr ""
"Profila / kontua goitibehera — goiko barra globaletik irekitzen da.\n"
"\n"
"Edukia modu natiboan marrazten du `layout.mixar_profile_card()`\n"
"(`interface_mixar_profile_card.cc`) funtzioak: agurra, planaren etiketa,\n"
"kredituen erabilera-neurgailua eta kontu-ekintzak, txartel bakar batean\n"
"antolatuta, menu gisa beharrean. Python-ek erregistratzea eta txartelak\n"
"deitzen duen operadore bakoitza ditu oraindik — C++-k pixelak soilik.\n"

